      "biography": {
        "value": "<h2>Description</h2><p>These tentacles constructs follow the commands of the Ruby Weapon. A left and right tentacle that drain HPs and MPs with their attacks.</p><h2>Defense</h2><p>AC 21, touch 9; flat-footed 21 (+12 natural, -1 size)</p><p>hp 150 [240] (10d10+30)</p><p>Fort +7, Ref +7, Will +7</p><p>DR 5/-; Immune Construct traits, Status effects, Water;</p><h2>Offense</h2><p>Speed Burrow 80 ft. [cannot be farther than 300 ft. from Ruby Weapon's location]</p><p>Melee Left Tentacle +14 (1d8+10 MP damage plus poison and slow) and Right Tentacle +14 (4d8+10 plus frog and mini)</p><p>Space 10 ft.; Reach 20 ft.</p><p>Special Attacks Comet Fall, Frog (1d4+1 rounds, DC 25), Poison (1d4+1 rounds, DC 25), Small (1d4+1 rounds, DC 25), Slow (1d4+1 rounds, DC 25)</p><h2>Statistics</h2><p>Str 30, Dex 10, Con —, Int —, Wis 11, Cha 1</p><p>Base Atk +10; CMB +21; CMD 31</p><p>SQ Comet Fall, Improved Evasion</p>"
      }
